#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Manage compute and data across your Qiskit pattern with Qiskit Serverless."
msgstr ""
"Kelola komputasi dan data di seluruh pola Qiskit kamu dengan Qiskit "
"Serverless."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage Qiskit Serverless compute and data resources"
msgstr "Kelola sumber daya komputasi dan data Qiskit Serverless"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/serverless-manage-resources.ipynb\" "
"/>\n"
msgstr ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/serverless-manage-resources.ipynb\" "
"/>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Versi paket\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kode di halaman ini dikembangkan menggunakan persyaratan berikut.\n"
"Kami sarankan menggunakan versi ini atau yang lebih baru.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless is getting an upgrade, and its features are changing fast.** During this development phase, find release notes and the most recent documentation at the [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless sedang mendapatkan peningkatan, dan fitur-fiturnya berubah dengan cepat.** Selama fase pengembangan ini, temukan catatan rilis dan dokumentasi terbaru di halaman [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With Qiskit Serverless, you can manage compute and data across your [Qiskit "
"pattern](/guides/intro-to-patterns), including CPUs, QPUs, and other compute"
" accelerators.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dengan Qiskit Serverless, kamu bisa mengelola komputasi dan data di seluruh "
"[pola Qiskit](/guides/intro-to-patterns), termasuk CPU, QPU, dan akselerator"
" komputasi lainnya.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set detailed statuses {#set-detailed-statuses}"
msgstr "Atur status terperinci {#set-detailed-statuses}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Serverless workloads have several stages across a workflow. By default, the "
"following statuses are viewable with `job.status()`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Beban kerja Serverless memiliki beberapa tahap dalam sebuah alur kerja. "
"Secara default, status berikut bisa dilihat dengan `job.status()`:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**`QUEUED`**: the workload is queued for classical resources\n"
msgstr ""
"**`QUEUED`**: beban kerja sedang dalam antrean untuk sumber daya klasik\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**`INITIALIZING`**: the workload is set up\n"
msgstr "**`INITIALIZING`**: beban kerja sedang disiapkan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**`RUNNING`**: the workload is currently running on classical resources\n"
msgstr "**`RUNNING`**: beban kerja sedang berjalan di sumber daya klasik\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**`DONE`**: the workload has successfully completed\n"
msgstr "**`DONE`**: beban kerja telah berhasil diselesaikan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can also set custom statuses that further describe the specific workflow"
" stage, as follows.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu juga bisa mengatur status kustom yang lebih mendeskripsikan tahap alur "
"kerja tertentu, seperti berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"If you're reading the code cells locally in a notebook, you will see the `%%writefile` [magic command](https://ipython.readthedocs.io/en/stable/interactive/magics.html#cellmagic-writefile). Executing cells with this magic command saves them to disk rather than executing them.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"Jika kamu membaca sel-sel kode ini secara lokal di sebuah notebook, kamu akan melihat [perintah magic](https://ipython.readthedocs.io/en/stable/interactive/magics.html#cellmagic-writefile) `%%writefile`. Menjalankan sel dengan perintah magic ini akan menyimpannya ke disk alih-alih menjalankannya.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After successful completion of this workload (with `save_result()`), this "
"status will be updated to `DONE` automatically.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah beban kerja selesai dengan sukses (menggunakan `save_result()`), "
"status ini akan otomatis diperbarui menjadi `DONE`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Parallel workflows {#parallel-workflows}"
msgstr "Alur kerja paralel {#parallel-workflows}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For classical tasks that can be parallelized, use the `@distribute_task` "
"decorator to define compute requirements needed to perform a task. Start by "
"recalling the `transpile_remote.py` example from the [Write your first "
"Qiskit Serverless program](/guides/serverless-first-program) topic with the "
"following code.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk tugas-tugas klasik yang bisa diparalelkan, gunakan dekorator "
"`@distribute_task` untuk mendefinisikan kebutuhan komputasi yang diperlukan "
"untuk menjalankan sebuah tugas. Mulai dengan mengingat kembali contoh "
"`transpile_remote.py` dari topik [Tulis program Qiskit Serverless "
"pertamamu](/guides/serverless-first-program) dengan kode berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following code requires that you have already [saved your "
"credentials](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kode berikut mengharuskan kamu sudah [menyimpan kredensial "
"kamu](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this example, you decorated the `transpile_remote()` function with "
"`@distribute_task(target={\"cpu\": 1})`. When run, this creates an "
"asynchronous parallel worker task with a single CPU core, and returns with a"
" reference to track the worker. To fetch the result, pass the reference to "
"the `get()` function. We can use this to run multiple parallel tasks:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam contoh ini, kamu mendekorasi fungsi `transpile_remote()` dengan "
"`@distribute_task(target={\"cpu\": 1})`. Saat dijalankan, ini membuat tugas "
"worker paralel asinkron dengan satu inti CPU, dan mengembalikan referensi "
"untuk melacak worker tersebut. Untuk mengambil hasilnya, teruskan referensi "
"ke fungsi `get()`. Kita bisa menggunakannya untuk menjalankan beberapa tugas"
" paralel:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Explore different task configurations {#explore-different-task-"
"configurations}"
msgstr ""
"Eksplorasi konfigurasi tugas yang berbeda {#explore-different-task-"
"configurations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can flexibly allocate CPU, GPU, and memory for your tasks via "
"`@distribute_task()`. For Qiskit Serverless on IBM Quantum&reg; Platform, "
"each program is equipped with 16 CPU cores and 32 GB RAM, which can be "
"allocated dynamically as needed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa mengalokasikan CPU, GPU, dan memori untuk tugas-tugasmu secara "
"fleksibel melalui `@distribute_task()`. Untuk Qiskit Serverless di IBM "
"Quantum&reg; Platform, setiap program dilengkapi dengan 16 inti CPU dan 32 "
"GB RAM, yang bisa dialokasikan secara dinamis sesuai kebutuhan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"CPU cores can be allocated as full CPU cores, or even fractional "
"allocations, as shown in the following.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inti CPU bisa dialokasikan sebagai inti CPU penuh, atau bahkan alokasi "
"pecahan, seperti yang ditunjukkan berikut ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Memory is allocated in number of bytes. Recall that there are 1024 bytes in "
"a kilobyte, 1024 kilobytes in a megabyte, and 1024 megabytes in a gigabyte. "
"To allocate 2 GB of memory for your worker, you need to allocate `\"mem\": 2"
" * 1024 * 1024 * 1024`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Memori dialokasikan dalam jumlah byte. Ingat bahwa ada 1024 byte dalam satu "
"kilobyte, 1024 kilobyte dalam satu megabyte, dan 1024 megabyte dalam satu "
"gigabyte. Untuk mengalokasikan 2 GB memori bagi worker kamu, kamu perlu "
"mengalokasikan `\"mem\": 2 * 1024 * 1024 * 1024`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Manage data across your program {#manage-data-across-your-program}"
msgstr ""
"Kelola data di seluruh program kamu {#manage-data-across-your-program}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Serverless allows you to manage files in the `/data` directory across"
" all your programs. This includes several limitations:\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit Serverless memungkinkan kamu mengelola file di direktori `/data` di "
"seluruh program kamu. Ini mencakup beberapa batasan:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Only `tar` and `h5` files are supported today\n"
msgstr "Hanya file `tar` dan `h5` yang didukung saat ini\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This is only a flat `/data` storage, and cannot have `/data/folder/` "
"subdirectories\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini hanya penyimpanan `/data` yang datar, dan tidak bisa memiliki "
"subdirektori `/data/folder/`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following shows how to upload files. Be sure you have authenticated to "
"Qiskit Serverless with your IBM Quantum account (see [Upload to Qiskit "
"Serverless](/guides/serverless-first-program#upload-to-qiskit-serverless) "
"for instructions).\n"
msgstr ""
"Berikut ini menunjukkan cara mengunggah file. Pastikan kamu sudah "
"mengautentikasi ke Qiskit Serverless dengan akun IBM Quantum kamu (lihat "
"[Unggah ke Qiskit Serverless](/guides/serverless-first-program#upload-to-"
"qiskit-serverless) untuk instruksinya).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, you can list all the files in your `data` directory. This data is "
"accessible to all programs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selanjutnya, kamu bisa melihat daftar semua file di direktori `data` kamu. "
"Data ini bisa diakses oleh semua program.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This can be done from a program by using `file_download()` to download the "
"file to the program environment, and uncompressing the `tar`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hal ini bisa dilakukan dari sebuah program dengan menggunakan "
"`file_download()` untuk mengunduh file ke lingkungan program, dan "
"mengekstrak `tar`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"At this point, your program can interact with the files, as you would a "
"local experiment. `file_upload()` , `file_download()`, and `file_delete()` "
"can be called from your local experiment, or your uploaded program, for "
"consistent and flexible data management.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pada tahap ini, program kamu bisa berinteraksi dengan file, seperti layaknya"
" eksperimen lokal. `file_upload()`, `file_download()`, dan `file_delete()` "
"bisa dipanggil dari eksperimen lokal kamu, atau dari program yang sudah "
"diunggah, untuk manajemen data yang konsisten dan fleksibel.\n"

